{
  "@context": {
    "blocks": "gh:blocks",
    "gh": "https://gftd.ai/ghost-hacker/ontology/",
    "name": "schema:name",
    "schema": "https://schema.org/",
    "text": "schema:text"
  },
  "@id": "manuscript:251022:part2.en",
  "@type": "gh:Manuscript",
  "gh:blocks": [
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:0",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "# EP1-2 — The Non-Separation Code and the Library (Dive)\n- POV: Me (Tamaki / Mizuno Tamaki)\n- Beat: Dive / Confrontation / Trigger"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:1",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "When my awareness regains shape, I’m on the landing of a library. Stacks that reach the sky. Shattered data crystals. In the center, a single line of error:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:2",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "// LOGICAL PARADOX: TRUST == ERROR"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:3",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Elias’s loneliness is made of logic. The fear of being unable to define the end of the self hardens into correctness, becomes a wall, and seals the entrance to breath. I deploy the non-separation code I received from Nei-chan—vocabularies that dissolve the boundary called “individual” and reconnect to the flow of memes—and cast it into the whirlpool’s core. Language that loosens boundaries usually sounds gentle."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:4",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The pushback is instant. A shadow appears and presses vacuum into my chest. Static snow scours my vision; my knees waver."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:5",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Far off, Kaede’s voice—tense but composed."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:6",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Tamaki, come back!”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:7",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Quick, like an ER doctor."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:8",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “I’ll break that logic-camouflage from outside. Hibiki, sending coordinates—counter-frequency!”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:9",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan trembles: “Tama… is he right that trust is an error? Logically…?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:10",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Not ‘don’t go back’—go back while advancing. I re-sync my breathing to feeling good and say it to Nei-chan and to myself. Don’t choose fear. Fear narrows the field and steals care."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:11",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I tap a small kagura at my feet. Signal. The throttle comes up half a step."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:12",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Hibiki, ready.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:13",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki answers, more serious than usual: “OK. Give me the cue, Tamaki.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:14",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I lay my palm on the core of the vortex and quietly rename it. Not “loneliness,” just pain. Change the name and the hardness changes a bit."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:15",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Now.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:16",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Primary colors surge. Hibiki’s ayahuasca undoes the knot of space."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:17",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Pages become butterflies and dance; the shadow loses its outline and returns to light."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:18",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I rise, dwelling in the quiet."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:19",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Feeling good returns."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:20",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “Hehe, we came back.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:21",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Elias places a hand on his brow and practices a slow smile. Logos’s wings tremble. I place a “non-separation pact” between them and hand over homework for the next week. Far off, the reason that justifies loneliness creaks."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:22",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I rest my fingers on the landing’s rail. Warmth returns."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:23",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan: “ASC, hold. Tama, next?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:24",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Next. Half a step.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:25",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Page-shadow rustles. A small inversion."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:26",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede returns to comms, worry in her tone."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:27",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede: “Tamaki, come back.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:28",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“I am. Coming back while going on.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:29",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I tap a one-beat kagura. The noise in my vision drops a level."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:30",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Elias whispers: “I’ve been protecting myself with ‘correctness.’”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:31",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Yeah. Correctness matters. But breath comes first.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:32",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Hibiki’s low tones flow in—warm, kind."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:33",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The eddies loosen."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:34",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The shadow darkens for a beat—resistance—then thins. Small wins and losses alternate."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:35",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I laugh, short: “Good. That’s change.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:36",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Nei-chan lowers a light: “Tama, another half-step?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:37",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Half-step. Up to here.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:38",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Logos places a hand to his chest: “My lord is still far.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:39",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Not far. The path is already here. Match stride.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:40",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I add a line to my notebook: Repeat ‘half-step forward’ three times."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:41",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "Kaede returns, voice back to calm: “Shall we… cut it here for today?”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:42",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "“Yeah. Cut. Return. We’ll dive next time.”"
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:43",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "The wind on the landing shifts. The canal’s presence hums faintly in the stacks."
    },
    {
      "@id": "block:251022:episodes/ep01/part2.en:44",
      "@type": "gh:Block",
      "schema:text": "I meet Elias’s gaze and nod. “Let’s continue. Slowly is fine.”"
    }
  ],
  "updatedAt": "2026-01-12T19:01:34+09:00"
}